@page "/about"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "關於我們";
    ViewData["BodyClass"] = "about-page";
}

@section Styles {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/pages/about.css" asp-append-version="true" />
}

<div class="about-breadcrumb page-breadcrumb"><div class="site-container"><a asp-page="/Index">首頁</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a asp-page="/About">關於我們</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">公司簡介</span></div></div>

<section class="about-hero page-hero page-hero--quote" aria-labelledby="about-hero-title">
    <picture class="page-hero__media">
        <source type="image/avif" srcset="/public/images/about/about-hero-container-yard-960.avif 960w, /public/images/about/about-hero-container-yard-1920.avif 1920w" sizes="100vw" />
        <img class="page-hero__image" src="/public/images/about/about-hero-container-yard.jpg" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
    </picture>
    <div class="about-hero__overlay page-hero__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="about-hero__content page-hero__content site-container">
        <h1 class="page-hero__title" id="about-hero-title">關於我們</h1>
        <blockquote>以「唯客思維、智慧分享」的企業文化及創新服務的精神迎向未來，追求永續，更創新局。<cite>董事長 黃福田</cite></blockquote>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="company-profile" class="about-profile site-container" aria-labelledby="company-profile-title">
    <div class="about-section-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT APLI</p>
        <h2 id="company-profile-title">公司簡介</h2>
        <p>亞太國際物流股份有限公司，前身為亞太儲運股份有限公司，成立於1973年8月7日迄今屆滿五十年。公司位於高雄港第三貨櫃中心後線，專注於貨櫃物流管理、船舶裝卸及機具維修保養等相關業務。</p>
        <p>以客為尊，提供優質的倉儲管理，並順應全球化風潮及網路時代，運用網路工具提升貨櫃維修、倉儲及碼頭裝卸的品質與效率。同時，我們結合運輸、報關、包裝、流通加工、資訊服務等，為海、陸進出口及轉運貨物提供全方位的物流服務。</p>
    </div>
    <figure><img src="/public/images/about/company-facility.jpg" alt="亞太國際物流廠區" loading="lazy" /></figure>
</section>

<section id="core-values" class="about-philosophy" aria-labelledby="core-values-title">
    <div class="site-container about-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">OUR PHILOSOPHY</p><h2 id="core-values-title">經營理念</h2></div>
    <div class="philosophy-gallery" data-philosophy-gallery data-default-panel="default">
        <div class="philosophy-gallery__image philosophy-gallery__image--default" data-philosophy-image="default" data-active="true" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="philosophy-gallery__image philosophy-gallery__image--mission" data-philosophy-image="mission" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="philosophy-gallery__image philosophy-gallery__image--values" data-philosophy-image="values" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="philosophy-gallery__image philosophy-gallery__image--vision" data-philosophy-image="vision" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="philosophy-gallery__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="philosophy-panels" role="group" aria-label="經營理念互動選單">
            <button type="button" data-philosophy-panel="mission" aria-expanded="false"><span class="philosophy-panel__content"><span class="philosophy-panel__icon philosophy-panel__icon--mission" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>使命</strong><span class="philosophy-panel__description">以創新服務精神迎向未來，追求永續，更創新局。</span></span></button>
            <button type="button" data-philosophy-panel="values" aria-expanded="false"><span class="philosophy-panel__content"><span class="philosophy-panel__icon philosophy-panel__icon--values" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>核心價值觀</strong><span class="philosophy-panel__description">專業團隊精神</span></span></button>
            <button type="button" data-philosophy-panel="vision" aria-expanded="false"><span class="philosophy-panel__content"><span class="philosophy-panel__icon philosophy-panel__icon--vision" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>共同願景</strong><span class="philosophy-panel__description">商品附加價值創造者</span></span></button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="certifications" class="about-certifications" aria-labelledby="certifications-title">
    <div class="site-container">
        <div class="about-section-heading about-section-heading--left">
            <p class="eyebrow">CERTIFICATIONS &amp; AWARDS</p>
            <h2 id="certifications-title">認證與獎項</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="milestone-timeline" data-milestone-timeline>
            <div class="milestone-content">
                <div class="milestone-panels">
                    <article class="milestone-panel is-active" data-milestone-panel="certifications">
                        <div class="milestone-era-label"><span class="milestone-era-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>認證與獎項</h3></div>
                        <div class="milestone-panel-events" data-collapsible-events data-initial-visible-count="8">
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2025</span><h3>取得職業安全衛生管理系統通過 ISO 45001:2018 驗證</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2025</span><h3>獲高雄市旗津區旗津國民小學頒發感謝狀（贊助114學年度推廣品格教育「師恩在心、四維同行」禮義廉恥揭牌典禮）</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2024</span><h3>榮獲臺灣港務股份有限公司「113年度裝卸承攬業金舫獎」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2024</span><h3>榮獲教育部體育署「運動好人才・企業動起來」表率群倫獎（推動企業聘用運動指導員）</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2023</span><h3>榮獲 1111 人力銀行「幸福企業」銀獎</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2023</span><h3>榮獲臺灣港務股份有限公司「112年度裝卸承攬業金舫獎」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2021</span><h3>榮獲臺灣港務股份有限公司「110年度裝卸承攬業金舫獎」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2019</span><h3>榮獲臺灣港務股份有限公司「108年度裝卸承攬業金舫獎」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2017</span><h3>獲屏東市華山社區發展協會頒發「第2屆華山論健‧愛心健走」感謝狀（鼎力協助舉辦活動）</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2017</span><h3>獲頒第63屆航海節高雄區慶祝大會籌備會「105年度高雄港貨櫃裝卸作業量績效斐然」獎座</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2016</span><h3>榮獲鴻明船舶貨物裝卸承攬股份有限公司「105年度高雄地區安全衛生優良協力廠商」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2016</span><h3>獲頒第62屆航海節高雄區慶祝大會籌備會「104年度高雄港裝卸貨櫃作業量績效卓越」獎座</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2015</span><h3>獲頒第61屆航海節高雄區慶祝大會籌備會「103年度高雄港裝卸貨櫃作業量績效卓越」獎座</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2015</span><h3>榮獲陽明海運股份有限公司「104年度高雄地區優良協力廠商」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2014</span><h3>榮獲臺灣港務股份有限公司「103年度貨櫃裝卸承攬業金舫獎」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2014</span><h3>獲頒第61屆航海節高雄區慶祝大會籌備會「102年度高雄港裝卸貨櫃作業量績效斐然」獎座</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2014</span><h3>榮獲高雄市後備指揮部辦理年度國防工業緩召業務評比績優單位</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2014</span><h3>榮獲第60屆航海節高雄區羽球聯誼賽冠軍。</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2013</span><h3>榮獲臺灣港務股份有限公司「客戶貢獻獎」(獎證字第1020301026號)</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2013</span><h3>獲頒第59屆航海節高雄區慶祝大會籌備會「101年度高雄港裝卸貨櫃作業量績效卓越」獎座</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2013</span><h3>榮獲陽明海運股份有限公司「102年度高雄地區優良協力廠商」</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2013</span><h3>榮獲臺灣港務股份有限公司「最佳貢獻獎」</h3></div>
