                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2009</span><h3>世新貨櫃獲頒萬海航運股份有限公司「共創年作業量達100萬TEU」紀念獎座</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2009</span><h3>獲頒萬海航運股份有限公司「共創年作業量達100萬TEU」紀念獎座</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2009</span><h3>榮獲交通部高雄港務局「98年度本港裝卸貨櫃作業量績效卓越」獎</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2008</span><h3>世新貨櫃榮獲Textainer Equipment Management「2008年度最佳貨櫃場獎」(Depot of the Year)</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2008</span><h3>榮獲交通部高雄港務局「97年度推行勞工安全衛生工安優良」獎</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2007</span><h3>榮登「TOP5000經營績效傑出企業」認證</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2006</span><h3>世新貨櫃榮獲Textainer Equipment Management「2006年度最佳貨櫃場獎」(Depot of the Year)</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2006</span><h3>公司前身亞太儲運股份有限公司榮獲交通部高雄港務局「95年度本港裝卸貨櫃作業量名列前茅」獎</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2005</span><h3>世新貨櫃榮獲Florens Container Services「2005年度全球卓越貨櫃場獎」(Worldwide Recognition For Depot Excellence)</h3></div>
                            <div><span class="milestone-event-year">2005</span><h3>公司前身亞太儲運股份有限公司榮獲交通部高雄港務局「94年度本港貨櫃裝卸量名列前茅、績效卓著」感謝獎</h3></div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="button--primary about-certifications-toggle" type="button" hidden data-collapsible-events-toggle aria-expanded="false"><span>查看完整認證與獎項</span><i class="ph ph-caret-line-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/js/pages/about.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
